   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">SHEPPARTON, AUSTRALIA - NOVEMBER 14:  A detailed view of Aero Bars are seen on bikes in the transition area in the lead up to Challenge Shepparton on November 14, 2015 in Shepparton, Australia.  (Photo by Michael Dodge/Getty Images for Challenge)</rdf:li>
