   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">PANAMA CITY BEACH, FLORIDA - NOVEMBER 07: Chris Nikic competes in the bike portion with his guide, Dan Grieb, during IRONMAN Florida on November 07, 2020 in Panama City Beach, Florida. Chris Nikic is attempting to become the first Ironman finisher with Down syndrome. (Photo by Michael Reaves/Getty Images for IRONMAN)</rdf:li>
