   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Gabriel Cobb, a triathlete with Down syndrome and parishioner at St. Joseph in Cottleville, posed for a portrait Wednesday, May 31, 2023, at Creve Coeur Lake in Maryland Heights, Missouri. (Photo by Jacob Wiegand | Catholic St. Louis | jacobwiegand@archstl.org)</rdf:li>
